emium Amenities – Includes a rooftop infinity pool, kids’ playground, club room, and EV recharge station.</li><li>High ROI Potential – Located in a fast-developing area popular with renters and investors.</li><li>Attractive Pricing – Competitive starting price makes luxury living accessible to more buyers.</li><li>Flexible Payment Plan – A convenient 60/40 plan makes owning a home more attainable.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1672,"cta":{"id":2457,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Pearl_House_by_Imtiaz_in_JVC_Dubai_2423b15ffc.jpg","hash":"Pearl_House_by_Imtiaz_in_JVC_Dubai_2423b15ffc","name":" Pearl House by Imtiaz in JVC, Dubai"},"style":null,"title":"Prime Living in the Heart of JVC","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Pearl House in Jumeirah Village Circle offers a serene yet connected lifestyle. Nestled within this vibrant community, residents benefit from close proximity to major highways like Al Khail Road (E44) and Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road (E311). Whether you seek leisure, work access, or daily conveniences, the location supports a balanced and dynamic lifestyle. The development is also within walking distance from Al Khail Mall and offers easy access to parks, schools, and retail centers.</p><ul><li>8 Minutes – Circle Mall</li><li>10 Minutes – Dubai Sports City</li><li>15 Minutes – Dubai Miracle Garden</li><li>15 Minutes – Dubai Hills Estate</li><li>20 Minutes – Mall of the Emirates</li><li>20 Minutes – Downtown Dubai</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":4177,"url":null,"file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/brochure_85363a0c10.pdf","hash":"brochure_85363a0c10","name":"brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestat