 Dubai with smart features and premium amenities."},"more_info":[{"id":7866,"answer":"<p>Pearl House is located in Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC), one of Dubai’s most family-friendly and well-connected neighborhoods. The Pearl House location offers quick access to Al Khail Road (E44) and Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road (E311).<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Where is Pearl House located?"},{"id":7867,"answer":"<p>Pearl House by Imtiaz offers modern studio and 1-bedroom apartments, thoughtfully designed with high-quality finishes and smart layouts.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What types of properties are available at Pearl House?"},{"id":7868,"answer":"<p>The starting price at Pearl House Dubai is AED 590,000, making it an attractive option for both investors and first-time buyers.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the starting price for a unit in Pearl House?"},{"id":7869,"answer":"<p>Pearl House offers a flexible 60/40 payment plan: 20% down payment, 40% during construction, and 40% upon handover.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the payment plan for Pearl House?"},{"id":7870,"answer":"<p>Pearl House at JVC is scheduled for handover in 2025, providing buyers ample time to plan their investment.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"When will Pearl House be completed?"},{"id":7871,"answer":"<p>Pearl House by Imtiaz Developments is a project from one of Dubai’s most trusted developers known for quality and design excellence.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Who is the developer behind Pearl House?"},{"id":7872,"answer":"<p>Residents at Pearl House enjoy premium amenities including a rooftop pool, gym, club room with billiards, EV recharge station, kids’ play area, and more.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities are offered at Pearl House?"},{"id":7873,"answer":"<p>Yes, Pearl House in Jumeirah Village Circle features smart home integration with Alexa-enabled controls, keyless entry, and remote A/C access.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is Pearl House a smart home community?"},{"id":7874,"a